{"seq":1,"slug":"functor-and-map","title":"函子与 map","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/functional-programming/functors-and-monads/functor-and-map","wordCount":795,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"函子与-map\">函子与 map</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p><strong>Functor</strong> 是实现了 <code>map</code> 的类型构造器——一个&quot;计算上下文&quot;，让你在不拆开上下文的前提下变换其中的值。两条定律保证 <code>map</code> 的行为可预测。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>概念</th>\n<th>定义</th>\n<th>意义</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Functor</td>\n<td>实现了 <code>map</code> 的类型构造器</td>\n<td>上下文中的值变换</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>恒等律</td>\n<td><code>map(id) === id</code></td>\n<td>映射单位函数不改结构</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>组合律</td>\n<td><code>map(f ∘ g) === map(f) ∘ map(g)</code></td>\n<td>一次 map 等价于两次</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>常见实例</td>\n<td>Array / Maybe / Either / Promise / IO / Tree</td>\n<td>容器即上下文</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Applicative</td>\n<td>Functor + <code>pure</code> + <code>ap</code></td>\n<td>支持多参数函数</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>要点：Functor 的关键词是&quot;上下文&quot;而非&quot;容器&quot;。Promise 是异步上下文，IO 是副作用上下文，<code>map</code> 统一了它们对内部值的操作方式。定律比接口更重要——违反定律的 map 无法参与等式推理。</p>\n<h2 id=\"什么是函子\">什么是函子</h2><p><strong>函子</strong>（Functor）是一个实现了 <code>map</code> 操作的类型构造器。直觉上，Functor 是一个&quot;容器&quot;或&quot;上下文&quot;，<code>map</code> 允许你在不拆开容器的情况下变换其中的值。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"haskell\" data-code=\"class Functor f where&#10;  fmap :: (a -&gt; b) -&gt; f a -&gt; f b&#10;&#10;instance Functor Maybe where&#10;  fmap _ Nothing  = Nothing&#10;  fmap f (Just x) = Just (f x)&#10;&#10;instance Functor [] where&#10;  fmap = map\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>class Functor f where</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  fmap :: (a -> b) -> f a -> f b</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>instance Functor Maybe where</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  fmap _ Nothing  = Nothing</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  fmap f (Just x) = Just (f x)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>instance Functor [] where</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  fmap = map</span></span></code></pre></div><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"type Functor&lt;F&gt; = {&#10;  map: &lt;A, B&gt;(f: (a: A) =&gt; B) =&gt; (fa: F) =&gt; F;&#10;};&#10;&#10;const arrayMap =&#10;  &lt;A, B&gt;(f: (a: A) =&gt; B) =&gt;&#10;  (xs: A[]): B[] =&gt;&#10;    xs.map(f);&#10;&#10;const optionMap =&#10;  &lt;A, B&gt;(f: (a: A) =&gt; B) =&gt;&#10;  (opt: Option&lt;A&gt;): Option&lt;B&gt; =&gt;&#10;    opt.tag === &#39;none&#39; ? opt : { tag: &#39;some&#39;, value: f(opt.value) };\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">type</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Functor</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">F</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">> </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  map</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">A</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">B</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">f</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">a</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> A</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> B</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">fa</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> F</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> F</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">};</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> arrayMap</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">A</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">B</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">f</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">a</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> A</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> B</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">xs</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> A</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[])</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> B</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    xs.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">map</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(f);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> optionMap</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">A</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">B</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">f</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">a</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> A</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> B</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">opt</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Option</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">A</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Option</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">B</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">> </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    opt.tag </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">===</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'none'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ?</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> opt </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { tag: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'some'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, value: </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">f</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(opt.value) };</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Functor 实例</th>\n<th>容器含义</th>\n<th>map 行为</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Array</td>\n<td>多个值</td>\n<td>对每个元素应用 f</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Option/Maybe</td>\n<td>可能缺失的值</td>\n<td>有值时应用 f，无值传播</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Promise</td>\n<td>异步值</td>\n<td>在 resolve 后应用 f</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Either/Result</td>\n<td>可能失败的值</td>\n<td>成功时应用 f，失败传播</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Tree</td>\n<td>树形结构中的值</td>\n<td>对每个节点的值应用 f</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>IO</td>\n<td>延迟执行的计算</td>\n<td>组合计算步骤</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    subgraph &quot;map 的直觉&quot;&#10;        C1[容器 [1, 2, 3]&quot;] --&gt;|&quot;map(x =&gt; x * 2)&quot;| C2[容器 [2, 4, 6]&quot;]&#10;        C3[&quot;Some(5)&quot;] --&gt;|&quot;map(x =&gt; x + 1)&quot;| C4[&quot;Some(6)&quot;]&#10;        C5[&quot;None&quot;] --&gt;|&quot;map(x =&gt; x + 1)&quot;| C6[&quot;None&quot;]&#10;    end\">graph LR\n    subgraph \"map 的直觉\"\n        C1[容器 [1, 2, 3]\"] --&gt;|\"map(x =&gt; x * 2)\"| C2[容器 [2, 4, 6]\"]\n        C3[\"Some(5)\"] --&gt;|\"map(x =&gt; x + 1)\"| C4[\"Some(6)\"]\n        C5[\"None\"] --&gt;|\"map(x =&gt; x + 1)\"| C6[\"None\"]\n    end</pre><blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> 不要将 Functor 局限理解为&quot;容器&quot;——它更准确的含义是&quot;计算上下文&quot;。Promise 是异步上下文，IO 是副作用上下文，它们都是 Functor。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"functor-定律\">Functor 定律</h2><p>每个合法的 Functor 必须满足两条定律，它们保证 <code>map</code> 的行为可预测：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"haskell\" data-code=\"-- 1. 恒等律：用 id 映射不改变结构&#10;fmap id == id&#10;&#10;-- 2. 组合律：映射组合 = 组合映射&#10;fmap (f . g) == fmap f . fmap g\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>-- 1. 恒等律：用 id 映射不改变结构</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>fmap id == id</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>-- 2. 组合律：映射组合 = 组合映射</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>fmap (f . g) == fmap f . fmap g</span></span></code></pre></div><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"type Option&lt;A&gt; = { tag: &#39;none&#39; } | { tag: &#39;some&#39;; value: A };&#10;&#10;const id = &lt;A&gt;(a: A): A =&gt; a;&#10;const mapOpt =&#10;  &lt;A, B&gt;(f: (a: A) =&gt; B) =&gt;&#10;  (opt: Option&lt;A&gt;): Option&lt;B&gt; =&gt;&#10;    opt.tag === &#39;none&#39; ? opt : { tag: &#39;some&#39;, value: f(opt.value) };&#10;&#10;const double = (x: number): number =&gt; x * 2;&#10;const increment = (x: number): number =&gt; x + 1;&#10;&#10;const val: Option&lt;number&gt; = { tag: &#39;some&#39;, value: 5 };&#10;const law1a = mapOpt(id)(val);&#10;const law1b = id(val);&#10;&#10;const law2a = mapOpt((x: number) =&gt; increment(double(x)))(val);&#10;const law2b = mapOpt(increment)(mapOpt(double)(val));\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">type</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Option</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">A</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">> </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">tag</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'none'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">|</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">tag</span><span style=\"colo