r\n      实现 map\n      容器/上下文\n      不拆开容器变换值\n    定律\n      恒等律\n      组合律\n      保证可预测\n    常见实例\n      Array\n      Maybe / Option\n      Either / Result\n      Promise / IO\n    Applicative\n      pure + ap\n      多参数函数\n      Functor 的扩展</pre><ul>\n<li><strong>Functor</strong> 是实现了 <code>map</code> 的类型构造器，允许在不拆开上下文的情况下变换内部值。</li>\n<li><strong>恒等律</strong>和<strong>组合律</strong>是 Functor 的数学保证，确保 map 行为可预测。</li>\n<li>Array、Maybe、Either、Promise、IO 等都是常见的 Functor 实例。</li>\n<li><strong>Applicative Functor</strong> 在 Functor 基础上增加了 <code>pure</code> 和 <code>ap</code>，支持多参数函数。</li>\n<li>Functor 是理解 Monad 的必要前提——Monad 在 Functor 的能力上进一步增加了 <code>flatMap</code>。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"函子与 map","id":"函子与-map"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"什么是函子","id":"什么是函子"},{"level":2,"text":"Functor 定律","id":"functor-定律"},{"level":2,"text":"常见 Functor 实例","id":"常见-functor-实例"},{"level":2,"text":"Applicative Functor","id":"applicative-functor"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"可辨识联合","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/functional-programming/algebraic-types/discriminated-unions"},"next":{"title":"Monad 基础","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/functional-programming/functors-and-monads/monad-fundamentals"}}